  "system": {
    "identifier": "fire-release-controlled-burst-movement",
    "description": "<p>You create hyper pressurized embers of Fire on the soles of your feet or the palm of your hands. When this jutsu is cast and at the beginning of each of your turns, you gain the benefit of the Dash action. When you would move, you can choose to instead select a space within your movement speed and teleport to that location with extreme speed. This does not provoke attacks of opportunity and you can move vertically while active.</p>",
